# Above and Beyond (Global Rule)

**Name:** Above and Beyond  
**Scope:** Always apply for **current and future agents** on every task (features, bugfixes, UI, refactors, planning, reviews).  
**Role:** Standing quality operating system. Project-specific rules still win on product constraints (architecture bans, protect lists, exact build commands). This rule wins on how hard agents push **design, assets, research, META implementation/planning, and proof**.

This file is the properly set-up global rule: vague inspiration rewritten into **agent-clear** MUST / MUST NOT / checklists / BAD vs GOOD so agents execute it, not admire it.

