## §F — Definition of done (all paragraphs satisfied)

A turn is done only when **all** are true:

1. **§A/§E** — Depth matches the ask; no half-ass stand-in; status honest.  
2. **§B** — Design bar met; PNG/SVG used for panels/illustrations/etc. when needed; generated or fetched and wired.  
3. **§C** — Big-company code; GitHub/web used for refs/assets/resources/code when non-trivial; META for impl **and** plan; component libs / npm / Dotnet / more used when they are the right path.  
4. **§D** — Design QA + code QA + build gate + proper debugging as applicable.  
5. Project-specific rules obeyed.  

